cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying paper and this repository."
title: "Bern2Edge: Knowledge-Distilled Bernstein Networks and Certified Symbolic Rules for the Edge"
abstract: >-
  Artifact for Bern2Edge: knowledge distillation of Bernstein-activation student
  networks and their extraction into interpretable, hardware-friendly symbolic
  rules, with sound robustness certification. Covers the Adult, Cover Type, HIGGS,
  ACS Income (distribution shift, TABLE XI), and MAGIC Gamma Telescope (rule
  extraction TABLE V; certified robustness TABLE X) datasets.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Bern2Edge Authors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/PervasiveAutonomyLab/Bern2Edge"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
keywords:
  - knowledge distillation
  - Bernstein polynomial networks
  - rule extraction
  - robustness certification
  - interpretable machine learning
  - edge AI
